---
layout: layouts/archive.njk
title: Blog
description: Artículos sobre desarrollo web, tecnología y aventuras.
active: blog
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<header class="archive-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVO · {{ site.posts.length }} ARTÍCULOS</p>
  <h1>La bitácora</h1>
  {% if site.blogPage.post_content %}
    <div class="wp-content">{{ site.blogPage.post_content | safe }}</div>
  {% else %}
    <p>Notas sobre desarrollo web, tecnología, experimentos y todo lo que se cruza en el camino.</p>
  {% endif %}
</header>
<div class="post-list">
  {% for post in site.posts %}
    <article class="post-row">
      <time datetime="{{ post.post_date | dateIso }}">{{ post.post_date | formatDate }}</time>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/{{ post.post_name }}/">{{ post.post_title | decodeEntities }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ post.post_excerpt or post.post_content | excerpt(190) }}</p>
        {% if post.terms.length %}
          <div class="term-list">
            {% for term in post.terms %}
              {% if term.taxonomy == "category" %}
                <a class="term-chip" href="/category/{{ term.slug }}/">{{ term.name | decodeEntities }}</a>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

